<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Advising Worksheet</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  th, td {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  th {
    background-color: #f0f0f0;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .header-section {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .title-block {
    width: 50%;
  }
  .info-block {
    width: 45%;
    text-align: right;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div class="header-section">
    <div class="title-block">
      <h1>MSU BILLINGS</h1>
      <p>Montana State University Billings</p>
      <p>Advising & Career Services</p>
      <p>Phone: {{ contact_phone }}</p>
      <p>Fax: {{ contact_fax }}</p>
      <p>Email: <span data-field="contact_email">{{ contact_email }}</span></p>
      <p>Website: <span data-field="website_url">{{ website_url }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="info-block">
      <h2>ADVISING WORKSHEET</h2>
      <p>MINOR IN OUTDOOR ADVENTURE LEADERSHIP</p>
      <p>GENERAL BULLETIN 2017-2018</p>
      <p>TRANSFER INSTITUTION(S): <span data-field="transfer_institution">{{ transfer_institution }}</span></p>
      <p>Name: <span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span></p>
      <p>Student ID #: <span data-field="student_id">{{ student_id }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Required Courses</div>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Course</th>
        <th>Course</th>
        <th>Credits</th>
        <th>Grade</th>
        <th>Semester</th>
        <th>Equivalent</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in required_courses %}
      <tr>
        <td>REC</td>
        <td><span data-field="required_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].course_name">{{ item.course_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="required_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].credits">{{ item.credits }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="section-title">Skills Areas</div>
  <p>Choose at least four skills/rescue courses in at least two different disciplines (e.g. climbing, fly fishing, skiing, etc.) from the following (continued on next page):</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Course</th>
        <th>Course</th>
        <th>Credits</th>
        <th>Grade</th>
        <th>Semester</th>
        <th>Equivalent</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in skills_areas %}
      <tr>
        <td>REC</td>
        <td><span data-field="skills_areas[{{ loop.index0 }}].course_name">{{ item.course_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="skills_areas[{{ loop.index0 }}].credits">{{ item.credits }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Course</th>
        <th>Course</th>
        <th>Credits</th>
        <th>Grade</th>
        <th>Semester</th>
        <th>Equivalent</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in skills_areas_page2 %}
      <tr>
        <td>REC</td>
        <td><span data-field="skills_areas_page2[{{ loop.index0 }}].course_name">{{ item.course_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="skills_areas_page2[{{ loop.index0 }}].credits">{{ item.credits }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <p>Total minimum credits required for minor: <span data-field="total_minimum_credits">{{ total_minimum_credits }}</span></p>
    <p>A minimum grade of C- is required in all minor courses.</p>
    <p>Certain courses in this program have prerequisites; students should check the course descriptions for required prerequisites.</p>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>